# Dataset card: cross-store price comparison, {{ pub.vertical_label }}

The same {{ pub.vertical_label }} products at {{ retailers | length }} US online stores, matched by barcode (GTIN), part number or name, with each store's price and stock, compared once a day. Rendered from the run of {{ day }}.

## Files

| file | rows | what |
|---|---:|---|
| `latest/comparison.csv` | {{ comp.products_matched | n }} | one row per product sold by 2+ stores |
| `latest/offers.csv` | {{ lg.offers_live | n }} | every product option at every store (open SCD2 versions) |
| `latest/possible_matches.csv` | {{ comp.possible_matches | n }} | candidate pairs below the confidence bar, never compared |
| `changes/YYYY/YYYY-MM-DD.csv` | {{ change_count | n }} on {{ day }} | price moves, new lowest store, stock changes |
| `precision/` | one per run | blind matching precision against GTINs |
| `runs.jsonl` | {{ status.runs_total }} | one line per run, with every data check |
| release `data-YYYY-MM` | | `offer_history_YYYY-MM.parquet`: every version of every offer in the month |

## Collection

- Public `/products.json` catalogs and product `.js` files of Shopify storefronts, read once a day from one GitHub Actions runner, within robots.txt, at least 3 s between requests per store, with a user agent that links to the repository.
- Prices in integer US cents (USD proven on a product page every run), availability as in stock / out of stock.
- Products in excluded categories (alcohol, tobacco/vape, weapons, adult, CBD, medicines) are never stored.

