## Limits

- The stores span clean, Korean and luxury beauty; most of their brands are sold by one store only, so most products are not compared (recon overlap: [decisions D-016]({{ blob }}/docs/decisions.md)).
- Prices are list prices on the store page; discount codes, member prices and shipping are not included.

